{"id":"edc520f758b19264","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-support.md","title":"Support","display":"df-support — Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-support","aliases":["58-df-support"],"display":"df-support — Support","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-support — Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,f,X,\\tau,Y,0_Y\\in V\">\\(S,f,X,\\tau,Y,0_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (topological-closure relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Support}_S\\)</span> (support value relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{Support}_S(S,f,X,\\tau,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land 0_Y\\in Y\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\!\\left(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0_Y\\},S\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{Support}_S(S,f,X,\\tau,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land 0_Y\\in Y\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\!\\left(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0_Y\\},S\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Support is the topological closure of the nonzero locus relative to a specified zero element <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_Y\">\\(0_Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former dependency <code>58-df-closure</code> denotes transitive set closure and is not the relevant topology concept.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S$ (topological-closure relation; see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,f,X,\\tau,Y,0_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}support} \\v